# Extort (CR 702.101a, 702.101b): Syndic of Tithes and Basilica Screecher each have extort, so every spell Bot1 casts triggers two
# abilities, each asking whether to pay {W/B} as it resolves. Casting the Screecher triggers the Syndic's: Bot1 declines, and the
# pool keeps its {B} (nothing is paid, nothing is lost). Casting Mox Ruby triggers both: Bot1 pays the first with the floating {B}
# and the second with Mox Jet's, so each opponent loses 2 life in all (1 for each ability) and Bot1 gains 2 on top of the
# 20 it began with; the pool is empty after.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Syndic of Tithes
Basilica Screecher
Mox Ruby
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

